<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 4</span>: </span><span id="S4.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Generalization error w.r.t. the number of model parameters or rehearsal samples, with <math id="S4.F4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T=8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T=8</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.F4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=1000" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1000</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.F4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\boldsymbol{w}_{t}^{*}\|^{2}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝒘</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\boldsymbol{w}_{t}^{*}\|^{2}=1</annotation></semantics></math>.
Subfigure settings: (a) <math id="S4.F4.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s=500" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s=500</annotation></semantics></math>; (b) <math id="S4.F4.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma=0.02" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.02</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma=0.02</annotation></semantics></math>; (c) <math id="S4.F4.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s=500" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s=500</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="S4.F4.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma=0.02" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.02</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma=0.02</annotation></semantics></math>. Discrete points denote averages across runs. </span></figcaption>
</figure>
